   1               	| «Paso a paso» demo for the Neo Geo AES (68000 + LSPC2-A2): everything on screen is a sprite or 
   2               	| A ball made of two chained sprites (32 × 32) moves one pixel per frame over a ground strip of 20
   3               	| sprites; the fix layer writes «NEO GEO». The trace starts at the cartridge's USER entry ($122):
   4               	| (SNK's BIOS, not included) has already checked the cartridge, cleared VRAM and palettes and calle
   5               	| Assembled with GNU as for the 68000 (binutils-m68k-linux-gnu); see build.sh. Licence: CC0 1.0.
   6               	| Each «[tag]» names the Spanish explanation in explicaciones.es.txt.
